            <note corresp="#d299-f1" n="96" xml:id="d299-f1-content">
                <p>Latter not printed; it quoted a letter of December 10 from the British Chargé in
                    Moscow to the Soviet Foreign Minister (740.00119 EW 1939/12–1344).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f2" n="97" xml:id="d299-f2-content">
